3.  **Connectivity Condition:** All people in the subset are connected either directly or through a chain of common friends.

To check connectivity, we can perform a Depth First Search (DFS) or Breadth First Search (BFS) starting from an arbitrary person in the subset and ensuring that we can reach all other people in the subset.

