The problem asks us to check if Alice can win the 5-in-a-row game in one move by placing an 'X' in an empty cell. We are given a 10x10 board represented by a 2D array of characters. We need to iterate through all empty cells, temporarily place an 'X' in each of them, and check if this placement leads to a win for Alice (i.e., if there is a row, column, or diagonal of at least 5 consecutive 'X's). After checking each empty cell, we revert the change and continue to the next one.

